<p><strong>As of {{ site.verified }}, this site has no affiliate links, no advertising and no sponsored listings.</strong> It earns nothing from any lab or product mentioned.</p>
<h2>What may change</h2>
<p>We may apply to affiliate programs run by water-testing companies in the future. If we are accepted and add links, then:</p>
<ul>
<li>every page with such a link will say so near the top, in plain words;</li>
<li>affiliate links will be marked as such (for example with <code>rel="sponsored"</code>);</li>
<li>being an affiliate will not change what a state agency list says or whether a lab is listed. Government-sourced listings are not for sale and not ranked by payment;</li>
<li>this page will name the programs we belong to.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Programs</h2>
<p>None active.</p>
<h2>Why this page exists</h2>
<p>The US Federal Trade Commission expects clear disclosure of material connections between a site and the products it links to. We publish this page before there is anything to disclose so the policy exists from the start.</p>
